    "referenceCode": "/* ************************************************************************** */\n/*                                                                            */\n/*                                                        :::      ::::::::   */\n/*   ft_strlen.c                                        :+:      :+:    :+:   */\n/*                                                    +:+ +:+         +:+     */\n/*   By: jcluzet <jo@cluzet.fr>                     +#+  +:+       +#+        */\n/*                                                +#+#+#+#+#+   +#+           */\n/*   Created: 2017/07/14 14:51:14 by fwuensch          #+#    #+#             */\n/*   Updated: 2021/06/20 18:26:46 by jcluzet          ###   ########.fr       */\n/*                                                                            */\n/* ************************************************************************** */\n\nint\t\tft_strlen(char *str)\n{\n\tint i;\n\n\ti = 0;\n\twhile(str[i])\n\t\ti++;\n\treturn (i);\n}\n",
